<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "released by"@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between a review and the agent publishing it. It might be the author of the review or conference or journal to which the scientific resource was submitted to."@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/spar/fr/ReviewVersion> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/spar/fr/> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/releasedBy> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n	:my-review-version a fr:ReviewVersion ;\n		fr:releasedBy :my-conference .\n\n	:my-conference a foaf:Agent .\n    " .
